hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"43","Subboohun Quddoos, Rabbul malaikati war-Rooh. Glorified, Most Holy, Lord of the angels and the Spirit"
"44","Allāhumma laka sajadtu wa bika āmantu wa laka aslamtu, sajada wajhi lladhī khalaqahu wa ṣawwarahu wa shaqqa samʿahu wa baṣarah, tabāraka Allāhu aḥsanu al-khāliqīn.. O Allah, to You I have prostrated, in You I have believed, and to You I have submitted. My face has prostrated to the One who created it, shaped it, and gave it hearing and sight. Blessed is Allah, the Best of creators."
